WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.476
A longer program is made of parts, and each part does one job.

2
00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:08.302
First, pick a secret and ask for a guess.

3
00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:12.033
Keep going until the guess is the secret.

4
00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:16.309
Check the guess, answer it, ask again, and count.
